== 8. results (tokens/s, mean of each request's decode speed)
set         regular  megakernel  speedup   SGLang   published (regular / megakernel)
gsm8k             -        1036        -        -   535 / 1091
humaneval         -         852        -        -   443 / 913
mt-bench          -         773        -        -   412 / 824

published: MI355X, ROCm 10.0, GPU_MAX_HW_QUEUES=1 on both paths (the script's default). On ROCm 7.2.4 at HIP's defaults: 481 / 1,105, 406 / 924, 368 / 846 (2.3x); on ROCm 10 the hardware-queue setting also sped up the regular path on that MI355X.
The megakernel is not bit-reproducible run to run, so speeds move by a few percent with the acceptance length.
